  "hypothesis": "A newly active run topic can be discovered only after the next UI refresh; subscription delay can exceed12 seconds. Hidden/busy pages can delay refresh further. This is a code-supported risk, not a reconstructed explanation of the actual batch.",
  "minimum_normal_supported_correction": [
